  "body": "# The Installed-Build Reliability Upgrade\n\nThis release focuses on keeping installed apps rock-solid—especially when loading key modules like search and memory. Onward and upward! 🎉\n\n## Highlights\n\n### Modules & installed builds 🧩\nA targeted hotfix improves module admission in installed builds so critical modules load correctly again—unblocking both search (`tinysearch`) and memory (`tinymemory`) where they could previously fail due to module directory permission checks.  \n\n([#7155](https://github.com/tinyhumansai/openhuman/pull/7155)) — Thank you @senamakel!\n\n## Contributor Credits\nThanks to @senamakel for the fix and the fast turnaround!\n\n## Full Compare\nhttps://github.com/tinyhumansai/openhuman/compare/v0.64.14...v0.64.15\n",
